{"id":"fvs656ed5lpnag0cijxx8j1ar","title":"编程的讣告：编码智能体夺走程序员的解谜乐趣","originalTitle":"My obituary for programming","summary":"Simon Willison 的链接博客转引 Jeremy Scheff 的观察：编码智能体与 LLM 正夺走职业程序员从代码解谜中获得的乐趣。Scheff 描述编程曾是把棘手逻辑谜题当差事、越难报酬越高、普通人做不了因而报酬丰厚的职业，程序员自行制定策略与时间表、界定何为可能。对享受构建可用系统的程序员，LLM 是持续馈赠；对以解决这些问题为乐的人，这种损失真实存在。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Simon Willison"},"links":{"original":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/19/my-obituary-for-programming/"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-19T23:58:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-20T00:16:32.063Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-20T00:16:32.063Z","category":"opinion","tags":["大佬观点","编码","Agent"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"9f542dae-0489-4154-b0ea-3ccac7b52dd7","title":"Simon Willison 转引：编码智能体夺走程序员解谜乐趣"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"9f542dae-0489-4154-b0ea-3ccac7b52dd7","title":"Simon Willison 转引：编码智能体夺走程序员解谜乐趣"}],"topics":[{"slug":"agent","name":"Agent 智能体"},{"slug":"coding","name":"AI 编码"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"大佬观点"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"frBpq-DlbCkQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}